    "Name": "BusterHauler BC-QSA2",
    "Details": "Tired of raiders camping out just out of range? Need to carry cargo and reach out and touch someone? Quicksell has you covered with our second BusterHauler variant, equipped with a Thumper Cannon, mortar, and a Long Tom, as well as some bolt on rockets for when enemies try and close in! It also makes a great way to clear land for any new expansions or landing zones - just swap the ammo out for infernos.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.57</color></b>",
